    {
      "id": "p0186-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby noted that this generic \"there's nothing here\" line is actually a direct quote from Brandish. He also mentioned that it wasn't important to retain the quote in the Japanese Undertale script. Even so, the translator did some research and included the equivalent quote from a Japanese version of Brandish.",
        "raw": "Toby noted that this generic \"there's nothing here\" line is actually a direct quote\nfrom Brandish. He also mentioned that it wasn't important to retain the quote\nin the Japanese Undertale script. Even so, the translator did some research and\nincluded the equivalent quote from a Japanese version of Brandish.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29572999,
          0.38842857,
          0.9002617,
          0.45538571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29015977,
          0.38771429,
          0.90258941,
          0.45645714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          13,
          14,
          15,
          16
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 指出，这句寻常的“这里没东西”式提示，其实直接引用了《Brandish》。他也说，日文版《Undertale》不必保留这个引用。即便如此，译者还是查找了资料，采用了日文版《Brandish》中对应的台词。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
