    {
      "id": "p0186-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The Japanese version of Brandish has been re-released many times over the past thirty years. Because each version has slightly different text, there is no single \"too dark to see\" line in Japanese - the line is different in each release. Of these, the Japanese version of Undertale quotes the PC Engine port of Brandish:",
        "raw": "The Japanese version of Brandish has been re-released many times over the past\nthirty years. Because each version has slightly different text, there is no single\n\"too dark to see\" line in Japanese - the line is different in each release. Of these,\nthe Japanese version of Undertale quotes the PC Engine port of Brandish:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2921927,
          0.47058571,
          0.90055648,
          0.53652143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
